# Run data gen before client/server

`src/generated/` is gitignored. Datapack output (Curios slot/entity JSON, item tags, recipes, loot) only exists after `runData`. Switching branches (for example onto Forge 1.20.1) leaves that folder missing or stale; Curios then rejects quivers and other slotted items.

## Required order

1. `./gradlew runData` (Gradle must run on **Java 17**)
2. Then `runClient` or `runServer` (Gradle or IDE)

Do not launch or ask the user to launch client/server until `runData` has succeeded on the current branch. Gradle `prepareRunClient` / `prepareRunServer` already depend on `runData`; still run `runData` explicitly after a branch switch or a clean checkout.

Output: `src/generated/resources/` (already on the main resource source set).
